+mproi_spi programmer
+^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
+
+Supports the Mini-Pro-I (MinproI) USB programmer, USB ID ``1fc8:300b``. An optional ``spispeed``
+parameter selects the SPI clock divider index of the programmer firmware. Syntax is::
+
+        flashrom -p mproi_spi:spispeed=index
+
+where ``index`` is ``0`` (fastest, default) to ``7`` (slowest). Throughput is limited by USB round
+trips (about 90 KiB/s for reads), so lowering the speed is only useful for marginal connections.
+
+
